@RoomCraft_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5243

### Tüm tasarımları getir
GET {{RoomCraft_Api_HostAddress}}/api/designs
Accept: application/json

### Yeni tasarım ekle
POST {{RoomCraft_Api_HostAddress}}/api/designs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "designName": "Çalışma Odası Tasarımı",
  "roomType": "Çalışma Odası",
  "roomWidth": 3.5,
  "roomHeight": 3,
  "wallColor": "#F3EFE7",
  "floorColor": "#D8C3A5",
  "budget": 40000,
  "totalCost": 18000
}

### Tasarım güncelle
PUT {{RoomCraft_Api_HostAddress}}/api/designs/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "designName": "Güncellenmiş Çalışma Odası",
  "roomType": "Çalışma Odası",
  "roomWidth": 4,
  "roomHeight": 3.5,
  "wallColor": "#FFFFFF",
  "floorColor": "#D6C4A8",
  "budget": 45000,
  "totalCost": 22000
}

### Tasarım sil
DELETE {{RoomCraft_Api_HostAddress}}/api/designs/2

### Tasarıma mobilya ekle
POST {{RoomCraft_Api_HostAddress}}/api/furniture
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "designId": 1,
  "catalogId": "sofa",
  "name": "Koltuk",
  "type": "sofa",
  "category": "Oturma",
  "x": 120,
  "y": 80,
  "width": 220,
  "height": 90,
  "rotation": 0,
  "price": 22000,
  "zIndex": 2,
  "isLocked": false,
  "wallSide": null
}

### Tasarımın mobilyalarını getir

GET {{RoomCraft_Api_HostAddress}}/api/furniture/design/1
Accept: application/json